    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">A spellbook holds the written knowledge necessary to learn and prepare various spells, a necessity for wizards (who typically get one for free) and a useful luxury for other spellcasters looking to learn additional spells. Each spellbook can hold up to 100 spells. The Price listed is for a blank spellbook.</span></p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.mAMEt4FFbdqoRnkN]{Chill Touch}</p>\n<p>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.60sgbuMWN0268dB7]{Telekinetic Projectile}</p>\n<p>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.TVKNbcgTee19PXZR]{Shield}</p>\n<p>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.kBhaPuzLUSwS6vVf]{Electric Arc}</p>\n<p>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.atlgGNI1E1Ox3O3a]{Ghost Sound}</p>\n<p>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.J7Y7tl0bbdz7TcCc]{Ray of Enfeeblement}</p>\n<p>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.VosLNn2M8S7JH67D]{Blindness}</p>\n<p>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.N1Z1oLPdBxaSgrEE]{Vampiric Touch}</p>\n<p>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.8ViwItUgwT4lOvvb]{False Life}</p>\n<p>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.VlNcjmYyu95vOUe8]{Dimension Door}</p>\n<p>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.A2JfEKe6BZcTG1S8]{Fly}</p>\n<p>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.MlpbeZ61Euhl0d60]{Cloudkill}</p>\n<p>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.GaRQlC9Yw1BGKHfN]{Crushing Despair}</p>\n<p>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.2w4OpAGihn1JSHFD]{Black Tentacles}</p>",
